# .papercusp/memory/raw.md is an append-only, timestamped memory log written on every
# checkout (canonical tree, fork/drill pots). Concurrent appends on two branches always
# touch the same end-of-file region, so a normal 3-way merge conflicts on every sync-back
# (EI-26583573652314044: it stalled the P-016 drill pot's upstream sync for 3 days).
# Entries are order-insensitive, so keep both sides' lines.
.papercusp/memory/raw.md merge=union
